{"seq":3,"slug":"expiry-seasonal-obsolescence-risk","title":"效期/季节/过季风险（联164）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/lifecycle-deadstock-detect/expiry-seasonal-obsolescence-risk","wordCount":2126,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"效期-季节-过季风险-联164\">效期/季节/过季风险（联164）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WOS 告诉你&quot;按现在的速度还要卖多少周&quot;，但它不告诉你<strong>这些周还剩几周</strong>。库存的死亡有两条不同的时间线：一条由日历划定——泳装在九月之后就没有正价需求；另一条由产品自身的理化状态划定——鲜奶在保质期后不能再卖。前者叫<strong>季节性/过季</strong>，后者叫<strong>效期</strong>。识别的最后一步，是把 WOS 与这两条截止线对齐，算出&quot;在截止前卖完所需的流速&quot;是否现实。</p>\n<p>这个截止线的概念与生鲜冷链的处置逻辑同源：效期商品在仓储与运输环节需要温控保障，临期后其处置路径还要受食品安全规则约束。本 hub 不展开温控履约的细节，只从&quot;清仓降价决策&quot;的角度取用它的效期模型——即把效期剩余天数当成硬约束，输入降价时机与深度的计算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[库存批次] --&gt; B{是否有硬效期?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[剩余货架期 SL = 效期日 - 今天]&#10;  C --&gt; D{SL &lt; 周转所需天数?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| E{是否季节品?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[剩余销售窗口 = 季节终点 - 今天]&#10;  F --&gt; G{窗口 &lt; 周转所需天数?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| H{是否款式过时?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[替代款上市即触发贬值]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[仅按 WOS/库龄决策]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| K[效期驱动: 必须清]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| K&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K&#10;  K --&gt; L[进入降价与渠道分流]\">graph TD\n  A[库存批次] --&gt; B{是否有硬效期?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[剩余货架期 SL = 效期日 - 今天]\n  C --&gt; D{SL &lt; 周转所需天数?}\n  B --&gt;|否| E{是否季节品?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[剩余销售窗口 = 季节终点 - 今天]\n  F --&gt; G{窗口 &lt; 周转所需天数?}\n  E --&gt;|否| H{是否款式过时?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[替代款上市即触发贬值]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[仅按 WOS/库龄决策]\n  D --&gt;|是| K[效期驱动: 必须清]\n  G --&gt;|是| K\n  I --&gt;|是| K\n  K --&gt; L[进入降价与渠道分流]</pre><p>三类风险的共同点是&quot;截止线是外生的&quot;——不由运营的努力决定。这使它们比 WOS 更硬：WOS 可以通过加投放、加曝光改善，效期到点就是到点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效期风险-硬约束与法律边界\">效期风险：硬约束与法律边界</h2><h3 id=\"保质期与-最佳食用期-的法律区分\">保质期与&quot;最佳食用期&quot;的法律区分</h3><p>效期管理的第一步是把两种日期标记分清，因为它们在法律与处置上的后果完全不同。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>按欧盟食品信息法规 (EU) No 1169/2011，第 24(1) 条要求对&quot;从微生物学角度极易腐败、短期后可能立即危害健康&quot;的食品标注&quot;use by&quot;日期，超过该日期食品&quot;应被视为不安全&quot;；而&quot;best before&quot;（最短保质期）按第 2(2)(r) 条定义为&quot;在妥善储存下食品保持其特定品质的日期&quot;，本质是<strong>品质指标而非安全截止线</strong>（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32011R1169\">Regulation (EU) No 1169/2011</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这条区分对清仓系统是硬约束而不是定价细节：&quot;use by&quot;过期即不得销售，只能走报废或（在允许的司法辖区）特定处置；&quot;best before&quot;过后仍可销售，但降价的合法性与消费者接受度会受影响。系统必须在主数据里为每个 SKU 标注它遵循哪种标记，否则临期降价规则会落到错误的品类上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"剩余货架期与降级规则\">剩余货架期与降级规则</h3><p>对&quot;use by&quot;类商品，剩余货架期（Shelf Life Remaining, SLR）是唯一的决策变量。常见做法是按 SLR 分档触发固定降价档位，而不是让弹性模型自由定价——因为临期品的需求曲线不可靠，且容错空间极小。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE shelf_life_policy (&#10;  category_id      BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  date_marking     VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- &#39;use_by&#39; | &#39;best_before&#39; | &#39;none&#39;&#10;  slr_tier         INT         NOT NULL,   -- 1..4，越小越紧急&#10;  slr_min_days     INT,                    -- SLR 下限（含）&#10;  slr_max_days     INT,                    -- SLR 上限（不含）&#10;  max_markdown_pct DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL,  -- 该档位允许的最大降幅&#10;  channel_rule     VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL    -- &#39;in_site&#39; | &#39;outlet&#39; | &#39;b2b&#39; | &#39;disposal&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 例：冷藏乳品的四档临期规则&#10;INSERT INTO shelf_life_policy VALUES&#10;  (101,&#39;use_by&#39;,4,NULL,    3, 0.00,&#39;disposal&#39;),&#10;  (101,&#39;use_by&#39;,3,3,       7,15.00,&#39;outlet&#39;),&#10;  (101,&#39;use_by&#39;,2,7,      14,30.00,&#39;outlet&#39;),&#10;  (101,&#39;use_by&#39;,1,14,NULL, 50.00,&#39;in_site&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shelf_life_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  date_marking     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'use_by' | 'best_before' | 'none'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slr_tier         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1..4，越小越紧急</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slr_min_days     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SLR 下限（含）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slr_max_days     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SLR 上限（不含）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_markdown_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该档位允许的最大降幅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_rule     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 'in_site' | 'outlet' | 'b2b' | 'disposal'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 例：冷藏乳品的四档临期规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shelf_life_policy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">101</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use_by'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'disposal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">101</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use_by'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'outlet'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">101</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use_by'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'outlet'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">101</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use_by'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_site'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"效期与降价时机的耦合\">效期与降价时机的耦合</h3><p>临期品的最优降价时机与普通清仓不同：普通清仓可以等到需求曲线确认后再降，临期品不行——剩余天数越少，需求价格弹性越高（消费者知道你要清），降价窗口越短。研究显示对易腐品而言，<strong>早期就启动、分多次渐进降价</strong>往往既能提高收入又能减少浪费，因为不同折扣档位会吸引到不同价格敏感度的顾客群（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.23046\">Bhatia, Gülpınar, Aydın, &quot;Dynamic Markdown Strategies for Perishable Products: Waste Reduction versus Profitability&quot;, arXiv:2608.23046</a>）。这与下一章 <a href=\"../markdown-decision-optimization/markdown-timing-depth-elasticity\">markdown 时机/深度/频次</a> 的&quot;一次降到低&quot;直觉相反，值得对照阅读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"季节与过季风险\">季节与过季风险</h2><h3 id=\"季节窗口的识别\">季节窗口的识别</h3><p>季节品的销售窗口由需求曲线本身定义，而不是由日历上的季节名定义。识别窗口的稳妥做法是看该品类历史需求的<strong>周度季节性形态</strong>：找到需求从峰值下降到某个比例（如峰值的 20%）之后的周次，即为窗口终点。用固定日期（&quot;八月十五日之后停卖泳装&quot;）会在气候异常的年份误伤——暖秋会延长真实窗口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过季后的残值塌陷\">过季后的残值塌陷</h3><p>季节品的危险在于残值不是平滑衰减而是<strong>断崖</strong>。帐篷在七月的降价弹性正常，在十一月可能降到三折也无人问津，因为需求侧整个消失了。因此季节品的清仓时间表必须<strong>前置</strong>：目标不是&quot;卖到窗口最后一刻&quot;，而是在窗口内就把大部分库存出清。这直接决定了第 2 章 <a href=\"../markdown-decision-optimization/stock-to-go-clearance-curve\">stock-to-go 与清仓曲线</a> 里清仓曲线的形状——它不是线性的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过季与过时的区别\">过季与过时的区别</h3><p>&quot;过季&quot;是需求侧的日历现象（明年可能回来），&quot;过时&quot;是产品侧的永久贬值（明年不再流行）。前者可以持货过冬、明年再卖，但要承担仓储与资金成本以及明年的重复降价风险；后者必须当期处理。系统需要在主数据上区分这两个属性：一个 <code>seasonal</code> 标志加一个 <code>lifecycle_end_date</code>，前者决定&quot;能不能跨季持有&quot;，后者决定&quot;过时后是否还能回正价&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险的量化与优先级排序\">风险的量化与优先级排序</h2><h3 id=\"统一的-紧迫度-评分\">统一的&quot;紧迫度&quot;评分</h3><p>三类风险应被折算成一个可比较的紧迫度分数，才能排序处置。一个可用的构造是：把剩余时间折算成&quot;截止前允许的最大 WOS&quot;，再与当前 WOS 的比值作为紧迫度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>WOS</mtext><mtext>截止前剩余周数</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>7</mn><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = \\frac{\\text{WOS}}{\\text{截止前剩余周数}} = \\frac{Q / \\bar{d}}{\\,T_{\\text{deadline}} / 7\\,}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">截止前剩余周数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WOS</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4442em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5082em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着按当前流速无法在截止前清完，缺口越大越紧急。这个分数把 WOS（第 2 篇）与截止线（本篇）统一到了一个量纲上，是清仓候选池排序的直接依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优先级排序表\">优先级排序表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类型</th>\n<th>截止线性质</th>\n<th>可否跨期持有</th>\n<th>处置优先级</th>\n<th>典型渠道</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>use by 效期</td>\n<td>法律硬约束</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>站内临期专区 / 报废</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>best before 效期</td>\n<td>品质软约束</td>\n<td>短时可</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>站内降价 / outlet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生鲜季节性</td>\n<td>需求断崖</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>outlet / B2B / 捐赠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服装季节性</td>\n<td>需求断崖</td>\n<td>是（成本高）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>outlet / 跨季持有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>款式过时</td>\n<td>永久贬值</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>outlet / B2B</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"与法规约束的联动\">与法规约束的联动</h3><p>对&quot;必须处置&quot;的品类，选择报废还是捐赠/回收不是纯经济决策。欧盟生态设计法规 (EU) 2024/1781 引入了禁止销毁未售出消费品的规定，首批直接覆盖&quot;未售出的消费类服装、服饰配件及鞋类&quot;，并把&quot;销毁&quot;定义为废弃物层级中最后三项活动（回收、其他能量回收、处置），而&quot;准备再利用、翻新与再制造不属于销毁&quot;（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj\">Regulation (EU) 2024/1781，2024-07-18 生效</a>）。这意味着服装类目的&quot;销毁&quot;路径在法律上正在收窄，识别环节必须把&quot;可捐赠/可再利用&quot;作为可选项输出，而不是默认走报废。具体处置路径与残值凭证见 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">捐赠/报废与残值凭证</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[待处置批次] --&gt; T{是否属禁用销毁品类}&#10;  T --&gt;|是| U[优先 再利用/翻新/再制造&lt;br/&gt;捐赠或转售]&#10;  T --&gt;|否| V{残值 vs 处置成本}&#10;  U --&gt; W[取得处置凭证与重量记录]&#10;  V --&gt;|残值高| X[B2B 批量或拍卖]&#10;  V --&gt;|残值低| Y[回收或能量回收&lt;br/&gt;记录重量与去向]&#10;  W --&gt; Z[合规披露与审计留痕]&#10;  Y --&gt; Z\">graph TD\n  S[待处置批次] --&gt; T{是否属禁用销毁品类}\n  T --&gt;|是| U[优先 再利用/翻新/再制造&lt;br/&gt;捐赠或转售]\n  T --&gt;|否| V{残值 vs 处置成本}\n  U --&gt; W[取得处置凭证与重量记录]\n  V --&gt;|残值高| X[B2B 批量或拍卖]\n  V --&gt;|残值低| Y[回收或能量回收&lt;br/&gt;记录重量与去向]\n  W --&gt; Z[合规披露与审计留痕]\n  Y --&gt; Z</pre><h2 id=\"与识别环节的输出衔接\">与识别环节的输出衔接</h2><p>本节的输出不是&quot;某个 SKU 要降价&quot;，而是给第 2 章决策层的<strong>约束输入</strong>：每个候选批次的截止线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{deadline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、是否可跨期持有、以及由此推出的紧迫度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>。决策层据此决定降价的深度与频率——紧迫度高、截止线硬的批次走&quot;一次降到位&quot;，可跨期持有的批次走&quot;渐进试探&quot;。这个分工边界，是本章三篇与下一章三篇之间最重要的接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效期与季节性提供的是<strong>外生截止线</strong>，与 WOS 的&quot;流速&quot;是两个正交维度；判死必须同时看流速缺口与截止线距离。</li>\n<li>&quot;use by&quot;是安全截止线（过期即不安全、不得销售），&quot;best before&quot;是品质指标——系统必须在主数据中区分二者，否则临期规则会落到错误品类。</li>\n<li>临期品的最优策略通常是<strong>早期、多次渐进降价</strong>而非一次降到底；季节品的残值衰减是断崖而非平滑，清仓时间表必须前置。</li>\n<li>紧迫度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>WOS</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>截止前剩余周数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = \\text{WOS} / \\text{截止前剩余周数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WOS</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">截止前剩余周数</span></span></span></span></span></span> 把流速与截止线统一到一个量纲，是候选池排序的直接依据。</li>\n<li>处置路径受法规约束：EU 2024/1781 已对未售服装/鞋类禁止&quot;销毁&quot;，识别环节必须输出可再利用/可捐赠选项。</li>\n<li>生鲜效期的完整处置链条（温控、货架期、临期处置）在本 hub 之外；本篇只把它当作降价时机的硬约束输入。处置凭证见 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">捐赠/报废与残值凭证</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效期/季节/过季风险（联164）","id":"效期-季节-过季风险-联164"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"效期风险：硬约束与法律边界","id":"效期风险-硬约束与法律边界"},{"level":3,"text":"保质期与\"最佳食用期\"的法律区分","id":"保质期与-最佳食用期-的法律区分"},{"level":3,"text":"剩余货架期与降级规则","id":"剩余货架期与降级规则"},{"level":3,"text":"效期与降价时机的耦合","id":"效期与降价时机的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"季节与过季风险","id":"季节与过季风险"},{"level":3,"text":"季节窗口的识别","id":"季节窗口的识别"},{"level":3,"text":"过季后的残值塌陷","id":"过季后的残值塌陷"},{"level":3,"text":"过季与过时的区别","id":"过季与过时的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"风险的量化与优先级排序","id":"风险的量化与优先级排序"},{"level":3,"text":"统一的\"紧迫度\"评分","id":"统一的-紧迫度-评分"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级排序表","id":"优先级排序表"},{"level":3,"text":"与法规约束的联动","id":"与法规约束的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"与识别环节的输出衔接","id":"与识别环节的输出衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滞销/死库存识别与周供应量 WOS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/lifecycle-deadstock-detect/deadstock-identify-weeks-of-supply"},"next":{"title":"markdown 时机/深度/频次弹性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/markdown-timing-depth-elasticity"}}